# P1 FP sign-codegen end-to-end (LLVM-080t).
#
# Compiles tests/unit/llvm/e2e/p1_fp_e2e.c with the DADAO clang, links it against the
# project crt0 + linker script, and runs it on qemu dadao-m1 with semihosting.
# The guest exit code is the test result: p1_fp_e2e.c returns 0 only when
# double-precision fabs/copysign (lowered to the ISA `fosgnj`, contract-fp.md
# §7) compute the correct value, and a distinct non-zero code otherwise.
# qemu's process exit code is the lit result.
# RUN: %clang -target dadao-unknown-elf -nostdlib -Oz -x c -c %e2e_dir/p1_fp_e2e.c -o %t.o
# RUN: %llvm_mc --triple=dadao-unknown-elf -filetype=obj %crt0 -o %t.crt0.o
# RUN: %ld -T %linker_script %t.crt0.o %t.o -o %t.elf
# RUN: timeout 30 %qemu -M dadao-m1 -kernel %t.elf -semihosting-config enable=on,target=native -display none -nographic
